{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-500638:  libvirt security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "libvirt\n[9.0.0.-17.el9]\n- daemon: install logrotate configurations for all daemons (Partha Sarathi Satapathy) [Orabug: 40055979]\n- util: virFileChownFiles: do not follow symlinks (HE WEI) [Orabug: 40184758] {CVE-2026-63622}\n- remote: Fix integer overflow in RPC handler for virNodeGetFreePages (CVE-2026-18917) (Peter Krempa) [Orabug: 40184784] {CVE-2026-18917}\n- API/qemu: add async unplug flag to virDomainSetVcpu (Akash Kulhalli) [Orabug: 39870832]\n- API/qemu: add async unplug flag to virDomainSetVcpusFlags (Akash Kulhalli) [Orabug: 39870832]\n- qemu: thread async vcpu unplug through internal helpers (Akash Kulhalli) [Orabug: 39870832]\n- qemu: emit vcpu-removed event on unplug completion (Akash Kulhalli) [Orabug: 39870832]\n- conf,remote: add vcpu-removed domain event (Akash Kulhalli) [Orabug: 39870832]\n\nlibvirt-python\n[30:9.0.0-17.el9]\n- bump and rebuild",
